            "paragraph": "The average anthropogenic aerosol effect from all simulations is \u22121.00 W m\u22122 as compared to \u22121.02 W m\u22122 from those simulations where the global annual mean TOA radiation balance is within \u00b11 Wm\u22122.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
